   Please tell us the PALcode type (NT, OSF, etc -- use the console's
   SHOW OS command) and the PALcode version presently loaded into the
   system.  (If it was shipped with NT, it likely has the NT PALcode
   loaded.  If so, you'll need to switch over to the OSF/1 PALcode.)

